OL,3,AUS voters go to polls to decide who
OL,4,Awill control Congress for rest of
OL,5,ATrump's term
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoters are casting their ballots across
OL,8,Fthe US to determine who will control
OL,9,FCongress for the rest of Donald Trump's
OL,10,Fpresidency - watch BBC coverage above
OL,12,FAll polls are now open in the midterm
OL,13,Felections, with results due to come in
OL,14,Ffrom this evening in the US
OL,16,FA big Democratic wave; a Democratic
OL,17,Ftrickle; a good night for the
OL,18,FRepublicans - our North America
OL,19,Fcorrespondent walks you through the
OL,20,Fthree possible outcomes
