OL,3,AUS voters go to polls to decide who
OL,4,Awill control Congress for rest of
OL,5,ATrump's term
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump's Republican Party currently
OL,8,Fcontrols Congress' two chambers - the
OL,9,FHouse and the Senate - but Democrats
OL,10,Fare hoping to flip enough seats to win
OL,11,Fa majority in both
OL,13,FIf they control Congress, Democrats
OL,14,Fwould be better placed to block Trump's
OL,15,Fplans, and could also launch
OL,16,Finvestigations into the president and
OL,17,Fhis team
